insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The new system was adopted not because it was cheaper, but because it made the process more transparent in public institutions, as described in a public debate.','The process became less transparent after the new system was adopted.','The new system was rejected because it was not transparent.','The new system was adopted mainly because it reduced costs.','The main reason for adopting the new system was improved transparency rather than lower cost.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_19", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Even though the experiment was small, its results raised important questions for future research during periods of change, as described in a training program.','Despite its limited size, the experiment produced results that future studies should examine.','The experiment was too large to raise useful questions.','The results were ignored because the experiment was not small.','Future research became unnecessary after the experiment.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_19", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in small communities, as described in an evaluation report.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_19", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed when resources are limited, as described in a committee meeting.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_19", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change under careful supervision, as described in a student guide.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_19", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
