insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The new system was adopted not because it was cheaper, but because it made the process more transparent in schools, as described in a student guide in a urban academic seminar context.','The process became less transparent after the new system was adopted.','The main reason for adopting the new system was improved transparency rather than lower cost.','The new system was rejected because it was not transparent.','The new system was adopted mainly because it reduced costs.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Even though the experiment was small, its results raised important questions for future research for adult learners, as described in a pilot study in a northern academic seminar context.','The experiment was too large to raise useful questions.','The results were ignored because the experiment was not small.','Despite its limited size, the experiment produced results that future studies should examine.','Future research became unnecessary after the experiment.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in public institutions, as described in a professional workshop in a southern academic seminar context.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed during periods of change, as described in a policy review in a central academic seminar context.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change in small communities, as described in a classroom discussion in a online academic seminar context.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability when resources are limited, as described in a research summary in a evening academic seminar context.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_23", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
